The CMR Customs Declaration application is an application that allows to submit the declaration contents electronically to customs when entering Cameroon. The QR code created by this application can be only used at the following airport that equipped with electronic declaration terminal in the customs inspection area. 
Once you have downloaded this app, you can create declarations any time, and as many times as you need to offline, so this app is convenient if you download it before departure.

[Airports where this application is available]
*Please refer to the website of Cameroon Customs for the start date.
Bafoussam Airport;
Bamenda Airport;
Bertoua Airport;
Douala International Airport;
Garoua International Airport;
Salak Airport;
Ngaoundere Airport; and
Yaounde Nsimalen International Airport;
